            "is_markdown": true,
            "bug_id": 19025,
            "text": "Created attachment 3640\nPatch implementing .reattach tool.\n\nIt can occasionally be useful to rearrange items on the search path, without explicitly detaching and attaching those environments. I've attached a patch implementing a tool, `.reattach`, that can be used to move an existing object on the search path from one location to another.\n\nThe primary motivation here is to allow \"safe\" re-parenting of environments in this specific context, without needing to expose things like ENCLOS and SET_ENCLOS more broadly."
          }
        ]
      }
